"""Write schema/vocab.csv — the vocabulary seed.

Run: uv run python scripts/seed_vocab.py

Columns: kind, slug, canonical, aliases, implies, ambiguous, context, description
  kind        skill | topic
  aliases     '|'-separated surface forms (the canonical is always a surface form too)
  implies     '|'-separated slugs: a document tagged with this term is also tagged with those
  ambiguous   surface forms that count only with context (ordinary words: Phoenix, Spark, Go, R, Excel …)
  context     '|'-separated words; an ambiguous form counts when one of these occurs in the same section,
              or when any non-ambiguous form of the same term occurs anywhere in the document
  description one sentence, embedded for the semantic ("weak") channel; skills get a generated one

The script refuses to write when a surface form belongs to two terms or an implication
target does not exist.
"""

